Ways the change could fail a criterion (advisory — no verdict depends on these):

  pre-test-failure-modes
    [not_wired] pre-test-failure-modes/defect-not-rendered-before-tests
      The new defect-enumeration stage is computed in `pipeline.py`, but the review report path may still omit it or render it only after later evidence stages, so the output would not actually include failure-mode notes before test results are examined.
