    [scope_too_narrow] recorded-failure-fields/non-unique-defect-ids
      The per-defect identifier is only made unique within one enumerated answer, not within the whole review: `_defects_from` deduplicates against a local `seen` set, so two recorded defects from different obligations can still end up with the same `obligation_id/slug`-based id if the same slug is reused.
