    [missing_case] recorded-failure-fields/region-refs-can-be-dropped
      Recorded failures can lose their implicated changed-source regions when the labels are not present in `label_to_ref`: `_defects_from` filters `entry.code_refs` down to labels found in the current change set, so a defect answer that names a changed region label not present in the mapping is recorded with fewer or no implicated regions instead of preserving the model's full set.
